-c3256353134="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><h4 _ngcontent-ng-c3256353134="" class="mb-1"> This is an update to the original registration. This update was made on  Mar 20, 2026. </h4><p _ngcontent-ng-c3256353134=""> Reason for update: </p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3256353134=""> "This update formalizes the transition to Phase 2: p-B11 Fusion, integrating the 1N4148 Non-Reciprocal Logic Array and the NE555P Precision Timing Anchor. These modifications are necessary to stabilize the 15 Hz Aperiodic Heartbeat and ensure Majorana-1 Parity during the zero-cross strike, effectively eliminating the thermal noise found in legacy silicon architectures. The update further anchors the technical manifest to a Reproducible State (1a7041f) within the KHYS repository." </p></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----></p-message><!----><!----><osf-data-resources _ngcontent-ng-c3256353134="" _nghost-ng-c1644395274="" class="flex flex-1"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1644395274="" class="flex column-gap-5 flex-wrap row-gap-3"><a _ngcontent-ng-c1644395274="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="icon-container" href="https://osf.io/rgyzq/resources"><osf-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1644395274=""><span class="flex align-items-center w-full h-full"><i class="custom-icon-data-dark icon-resource-size"></i></span></osf-icon><p _ngcontent-ng-c1644395274="">Data</p></a><a _ngcontent-ng-c1644395274="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="icon-container" href="https://osf.io/rgyzq/resources"><osf-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1644395274=""><span class="flex align-items-center w-full h-full"><i class="custom-icon-code-dark icon-resource-size"></i></span></osf-icon><p _ngcontent-ng-c1644395274="">Analytic Code</p></a><a _ngcontent-ng-c1644395274="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="icon-container" href="https://osf.io/rgyzq/resources"><osf-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1644395274=""><span class="flex align-items-center w-full h-full"><i class="custom-icon-materials-dark icon-resource-size"