stopping rules: "Data collection will terminate immediately if any of the following Decoherence Triggers occur:Grid Leakage: Environmental 60 Hz noise exceeding 15% of the 15 Hz signal amplitude (triggering a high-impedance state in the 1N4148 gate).Vacuum Breach: Pressure rising above $1 \times 10^{-6}$ Torr.Target Completion: Successful recording of 1,000 continuous Unitary Cycles ($25.7$ mV stable output).Manual Override: Intervention by the Sovereign Operator to protect the hardware integrity."</p><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></osf-registration-blocks-data><!----><!----><h2 class="mb-4 ng-star-inserted">Variables</h2><!----><osf-registration-blocks-data _nghost-ng-c856716540="" class="mb-4 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c856716540="" class="mb-4 ng-star-inserted"><h4 _ngcontent-ng-c856716540="" class="mb-2"> Manipulated variables <p-tag _ngcontent-ng-c856716540="" styleclass="font-bold" severity="warn" class="font-bold p-component p-tag p-tag-warn ng-star-inserted" pc185=""><!----><!----><!----><!----><span class="p-tag-label">Updated</span></p-tag><!----></h4><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c856716540="" class="preserve-whitespace ng-star-inserted">Primary Manipulated Variable: Aperiodic Frequency Modulation ($\delta(f - 15\text{Hz})$)The core variable is the synchronization of the 15 Hz Aperiodic Heartbeat. This is tuned to match the Laniakea Current and the specific resonant frequency of the 99.99% Quartz Spine. 

