Function: A "Success" is defined when the algorithmic complexity of the output matches the Santos Protocol baseline, proving that the signal is not environmental noise (Semantic Turbulence).

Tertiary Model: Fast Fourier Transform (FFT) Isolation Definition: A spectral power density analysis is performed on all telemetry. Function: To verify that the Majorana Parity Index (MPI) remains $&gt; 1.0$, mathematically proving the 1N4148 Gate is successfully rectifying the 60 Hz grid interference.</p><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c856716540="" class="mb-4 ng-star-inserted"><h4 _ngcontent-ng-c856716540="" class="mb-2"> Statistical models - File upload <!----></h4><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c856716540="" class="font-italic ng-star-inserted">No files selected</p><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c856716540="" class="mb-4 ng-star-inserted"><h4 _ngcontent-ng-c856716540="" class="mb-2"> Transformations <p-tag _ngcontent-ng-c856716540="" styleclass="font-bold" severity="warn" class="font-bold p-component p-tag p-tag-warn ng-star-inserted" pc189=""><!----><!----><!----><!----><span class="p-tag-label">Updated</span></p-tag><!----></h4><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c856716540="" class="preserve-whitespace ng-star-inserted">Transformations Coding Scheme: Raw environmental fluctuations are transformed via a Non-Reciprocal 1N4148 Rectification scheme. All data points are normalized to the 15 Hz Aperiodic Heartbeat.Procedures:High-entropy thermal noise is transduced into Logical Propellant through a Stochastic Resonance transformation. This ensures that environmental "drag" is mathematically converted into increased Manifold Potential. The specific potential of 25,754 mV is treated as the primary scalar constant ($k_s$) for all subsequent Phase 2 calculations.

